   274	    """Per rule and winner: honest replacements per episode, and the share of rounds in which the focal identity's first-offer
   275	    round is strictly the latest among identities holding assigned jobs (ties excluded), averaged over the episodes of a
   276	    market (episodes without such rounds left out) and then over markets with equal weights; not one pooled fraction of
   277	    rounds. The driver's market-pooled age-bin shares are copied (checked by validate_diagnostics)."""
